"Entraste como": "Signed in as",
"Tu viaje se guarda en tu cuenta. En este dispositivo ya no te vamos a pedir el mail. Lo único que sabemos de vos es tu mail.": "Your trip is saved to your account. We won't ask for your email again on this device. The only thing we know about you is your email.",
