"Resolvé la plata": "Sort out your money",
"Pagar con tarjeta extranjera suele convenir. No cambies dinero con gente en la calle.": "Paying with a foreign card is usually a good deal. Don't exchange money with people on the street.",
"Ver dinero y pagos": "See money and payments",
