"La plaza de uno de los barrios más chicos y tranquilos de la ciudad, en el límite oeste.": "The square of one of the smallest and quietest neighbourhoods in the city, on the western edge.",
"La plaza del barrio, a pocas cuadras de la cancha de All Boys.": "The neighbourhood square, a few blocks from the All Boys ground.",
"Plaza de un barrio residencial del oeste, cerca de la cancha de Vélez.": "The square of a residential neighbourhood in the west, near the Vélez ground.",
