"Ideal para el desayuno antes de caminar el canal.": "Ideal for breakfast before walking the canal.",
"Brunch famoso con panqueques, huevos y buen café, a pasos del Canal Saint-Martin.": "A famous brunch spot with pancakes, eggs and good coffee, steps from Canal Saint-Martin.",
